Package: spiR
Title: Statistical Performance Indicators Data Access
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("World Bank", "DECDG", email = "decdg@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: World Bank DECDG [aut, cre]
Maintainer: World Bank DECDG <decdg@worldbank.org>
Description:
    Access World Bank Statistical Performance Indicators (SPI) data from
    GitHub. Provides spi_get(), spi_data(), spi_index(), and spi_aggregates()
    to retrieve and filter the three core SPI output datasets by country,
    year, pillar, and dimension. Includes metadata catalog functions,
    spi_indicator(), country_info(), spi_versions(), and visualization helpers
    for exploring SPI scores and trends.
URL: https://github.com/WB-DECIS/spiR
BugReports: https://github.com/WB-DECIS/spiR/issues
